:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">• 검사공정 설비(AOI/AVI/전기검사) 전문 운용</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">• ABF 등 패키지용 소재 공정기술</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">• JMP 및 파이썬 등 프로그래밍 가능자</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">• 대형·고다층 FCBGA 양산 경험</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">• 수율 개선, 공정 혁신 프로젝트 리딩 경험</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">• 고객 대응(기술 미팅, Audit) 경험</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">• 신규 라인 셋업, 공정 조건 표준화 경험</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">• 영어 커뮤니케이션 가능자</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
