      {
        "jobNoticeId": 1002193,
        "recSectorId": 2,
        "orgName": "패키지솔루션",
        "jobGroupName": "[경력] 반도체 기판 생산기술",
        "jobCodeName": null,
        "detailContext": "<p><!--StartFragment--><span style=\"font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-0.16px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">생산기술 직무는 고객의 니즈를 충족하는 제품을 생산하기 위해 공정 개발/혁신, 설비 최적화/자동화 등의 업무를 수행합니다. 또한, 양질의 제품이 생산될 수 있게 공정/설비 환경을 구축하고 제품 품질과 수율을 극대화하여 사업 성과 창출에 기여합니다. 생산기술 업무를 통해 새로운 공법을 개발하고 생산에 최적화된 설비를 설정하며 개인의 엔지니어링 역량을 높일 수 있고 사업 성과에 직접적인 영향을 미칠 수 있어 개인의 자부심을 높일 수 있는 매력적인 직무입니다.</span></span><!--EndFragment--></p>",
        "mainTask": "<p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">■ FCBGA Front/End of Line 공정기술 / 생산기술</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">- 회로 형성, ABF 라미네이션, Drill / Laser Drill</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">- Desmear, Chemical Cu Plating, Electro Cu Plating</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">- 공정 조건 최적화 및 불량 원인 분석</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">- 수율 개선, 공정 안정화, 원가/품질 개선 활동</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">- 양산 이슈 대응 및 고객 Audit/기술 협업 지원</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">- OSAT(반도체 후공정) 생산기술 또는 개발 공정</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">- 검사 설비(AOI/AVI/전기검사) 전문 운용 및 공정 최적화</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-fill-color:initial !important;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.32px;margin:0px;orphans:2;padding:0px;position:relative;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-rendering:optimizelegibility;text-size-adjust:none;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">- ABF 등 유기소재 특성 이해 기반 공정 조건 개발 및 개선</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "majorCodeName": "<p><span style=\"font-family:Pretendard;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-0.32px;\"><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;display:inline !important;float:none;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;orphans:2;text-align:left;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">전기/전자, 재료, 화공, 기계, 반도체 관련 전공&nbsp;</span></span></p>",
        "locationName": "구미",
        "numbers": "0",
